# Nexa v1: Project Overview 🤖

Nexa is a small Arduino robot built by Harmain and Asfiya. It drives around avoiding obstacles, shows an animated face on a screen, and plays sounds. It was our first big hardware project, and we built it from scratch while learning as we went.

