## ✨ What Nexa can do
- **Avoid obstacles:** an ultrasonic sensor mounted on a servo looks left and right, and Nexa turns toward the clearest path
- **Show expressions:** an animated face with cyan rounded eyes on a TFT display
- **Play sounds:** audio stored on a microSD card and played through a speaker
